Z||000000||GTMike||10-27-2001||02:18 AM||||this is just a story that  happen outside in fornt of my house two min ago.  ]<P>so its midnight and i went out to put the sunroof back in my car  when all of a sudden.<P>these cars come screaming by my drivway. <BR>vrooom sss  vroommmm ssss vrommmm ssss.<P>3 ricers come zipping buy. one was an eclips with a park bench for a wing. one was a supra and one was a civic.  they were all turbo with turbo mods.   <P>so a 50 yards past my drive way they come to a screaching stop at the red light.    i hear abunch of chit chat. then i see the light is getting ready to change.  thats when all hell broke lose.<P><BR>vroom vrommm vroommm   i mean really loud.  louder than my gt with no cat.    then the light changes and off they go in a puff of tire smoke.<P>it was scarry.  i dont think i would ever put my fiero up aginst any of those cars.  they all had to be at least 13 second cars.  or it could have been more bark than bite.<P>i think they must have been off to find a back road to race or some thing. <P>well i just though it was kind of a cool story.  its probably  one of those you had to be there kind things.  <BR>||||reg||1
